                        <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/vm/monitor-virtual-machine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Learn: Monitor virtual machines with Azure Monitor</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://www.datadoghq.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Datadog</a> · <a href="https://www.manageengine.com/products/applications_manager/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ManageEngine Applications Manager</a> · <a href="https://www.paessler.com/prtg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paessler PRTG</a> · <a href="https://www.solarwinds.com/server-application-monitor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SolarWinds Server &amp; Application Monitor</a> (verified October 20, 2026)</li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/infrastructure/hosts">Maple docs: Hosts</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/explore/metrics">Maple docs: Metrics</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/explore/logs">Maple docs: Logs</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/alerting/alert-rules">Maple docs: Alert rules</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </article>
        </div>
    </main>

